#==============================================================================================
#
#   field_set_paintable - Painting::FieldSetPaintable: the paintable of a <fieldset>
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Painting/FieldSetPaintable.cpp (lines 1-144) and FieldSetPaintable.h:
#       creation, the block-start border the rendered legend widens
#       (https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html#the-fieldset-and-legend-elements),
#       the background clipped to the visual border box, and the borders with the top border
#       interrupted behind the legend.
